<view class="wrap">
  <view class="card flat">
    <view class="muted">这些设置只存在这台手机上，不进云端备份，换手机回默认。改完回记一笔立刻生效。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="sec-title">预设</view>
  <view class="card" style="padding:0 32rpx">
    <view wx:for="{{presets}}" wx:key="k" class="prow" bindtap="pickPreset" data-k="{{item.k}}" hover-class="btn-hover">
      <view class="ck {{p.preset === item.k ? 'on' : ''}}">{{p.preset === item.k ? '✓' : ''}}</view>
      <view class="flex1" style="min-width:0">
        <view class="pt">{{item.n}}</view>
        <view class="muted" style="font-size:25rpx">{{item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="sec-title">键盘左下角那颗键</view>
  <view class="chips">
    <view wx:for="{{fnKeys}}" wx:key="k" class="chip {{p.fnKey === item.k ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="pickFn" data-k="{{item.k}}">{{item.n}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="muted" style="font-size:24rpx;margin:8rpx">数字和小数点位置固定不变，只换这颗功能键——不让人把键盘改成不认识的形状。想用「常用账」就把它设成常用账。</view>

  <view class="sec-title">金额显示</view>
  <view class="card flat">
    <view class="row between">
      <view class="flex1"><view class="pt">千分位分隔</view><view class="muted" style="font-size:25rpx">开 = 15,120；关 = 15120</view></view>
      <view class="chip {{p.thousands ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="toggle" data-k="thousands">{{p.thousands ? '开' : '关'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="row between" style="margin-top:24rpx">
      <view class="flex1"><view class="pt">按键震动</view><view class="muted" style="font-size:25rpx">按一下轻微震一下，户外戴手套也能确认按上了</view></view>
      <view class="chip {{p.vibrate ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="toggle" data-k="vibrate">{{p.vibrate ? '开' : '关'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="row between" style="margin-top:24rpx">
      <view class="flex1"><view class="pt">⌫ 长按清空</view><view class="muted" style="font-size:25rpx">长按退格 = 一次清掉整串数字</view></view>
      <view class="chip {{p.longClear ? 'on' : ''}}" bindtap="toggle" data-k="longClear">{{p.longClear ? '开' : '关'}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="btn ghost" bindtap="reset">恢复默认</view>
</view>
